# Docker builds with the repo's root as their context (server/game-preview, a PR's preview) get only what the game's
# build reads: everything else (node_modules, tools' out/, .tmp, .git) is left out.
*
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!index.html
!vite.config.ts
!tsconfig.json
!src/
!public/
!scripts/pwa.ts
!server/game-preview/nginx.conf
**/AGENTS.md
**/CLAUDE.md
